{
    "title": "Reader by ElevenLabs",
    "description": "Your ultimate listening experience.\r\n\r\nElevenReader lets you listen to any text, articles, ePubs and PDFs like never before. With unlimited access to ultra realistic AI voices, you can level up your listening experience. \r\n\r\nTake this powerful text-to-speech app on-the-go as the ideal audio companion during your commute, at the gym, for work and school, or for accessibility uses. Powered by ElevenLabs contextually-aware Text to Speech (TTS) model, ElevenReader puts the highest-quality AI voice technology in your pocket. \r\n\r\nSee why users are selecting ElevenReader as their preferred AI text-to-speech reader.\r\n\r\nTEXT READER FEATURES\r\n\u2022 Get unlimited text-to-speech audio streaming\r\n\u2022 Choose from dozens of natural-sounding, human-like AI voices in your preferred style\r\n\u2022 Import your own text, paste links from the web, upload PDFs or ePubs, or scan printed text\r\n\u2022 Fully control your playback speed from 0.25X to 3X\r\n\u2022 Retain more by reading as highlighted words sync with audio narration \r\n\u2022 Listen in 32+ different languages for a truly global experience\r\n\r\nAUDIOBOOKS & CONTENT SELECTION\r\n\u2022 Discover hundreds of free books, newsletters, and blog articles for your interests\r\n\u2022 Listen to literary classics narrated with today\u2019s dynamic voices\r\n\u2022 Support indie authors by streaming up-and-coming work directly from writers \r\n\u2022 Select famous voices from our Iconic Voices Collection, featuring Maya Angelou, Sir Laurence Oliver, Burt Reynolds, Deepak Chopra, and Judy Garland\u2014 all licensed exclusively and in partnership with each icon and their estates\r\n\r\nABOUT ELEVENLABS\r\nElevenLabs is an AI Audio research & deployment company. Our mission is to make content universally accessible in any language & voice. We develop the most realistic, versatile and contextually-aware AI audio models.\r\n\r\nFor access to create your own AI voice clone or generate AI audio files and even more features, visit our web platform at https://elevenlabs.io/ \r\n\r\nTerms of Service: https://elevenlabs.io/terms \r\nPrivacy Policy: https://elevenlabs.io/privacy",
    "descriptionHTML": "Your ultimate listening experience.<br><br>ElevenReader lets you listen to any text, articles, ePubs and PDFs like never before. With unlimited access to ultra realistic AI voices, you can level up your listening experience. <br><br>Take this powerful text-to-speech app on-the-go as the ideal audio companion during your commute, at the gym, for work and school, or for accessibility uses. Powered by ElevenLabs contextually-aware Text to Speech (TTS) model, ElevenReader puts the highest-quality AI voice technology in your pocket. <br><br>See why users are selecting ElevenReader as their preferred AI text-to-speech reader.<br><br>TEXT READER FEATURES<br>\u2022 Get unlimited text-to-speech audio streaming<br>\u2022 Choose from dozens of natural-sounding, human-like AI voices in your preferred style<br>\u2022 Import your own text, paste links from the web, upload PDFs or ePubs, or scan printed text<br>\u2022 Fully control your playback speed from 0.25X to 3X<br>\u2022 Retain more by reading as highlighted words sync with audio narration <br>\u2022 Listen in 32+ different languages for a truly global experience<br><br>AUDIOBOOKS &amp; CONTENT SELECTION<br>\u2022 Discover hundreds of free books, newsletters, and blog articles for your interests<br>\u2022 Listen to literary classics narrated with today\u2019s dynamic voices<br>\u2022 Support indie authors by streaming up-and-coming work directly from writers <br>\u2022 Select famous voices from our Iconic Voices Collection, featuring Maya Angelou, Sir Laurence Oliver, Burt Reynolds, Deepak Chopra, and Judy Garland\u2014 all licensed exclusively and in partnership with each icon and their estates<br><br>ABOUT ELEVENLABS<br>ElevenLabs is an AI Audio research &amp; deployment company. Our mission is to make content universally accessible in any language &amp; voice. We develop the most realistic, versatile and contextually-aware AI audio models.<br><br>For access to create your own AI voice clone or generate AI audio files and even more features, visit our web platform at https://elevenlabs.io/ <br><br>Terms of Service: https://elevenlabs.io/terms <br>Privacy Policy: https://elevenlabs.io/privacy",
